    {"slug":"heaps-boundary-v2","skill":"heaps","type":"MULTI_SELECT","level":"ANALYZE","difficulty":4,"prompt":"Select every operation supported efficiently by a binary min-heap.","explanation":"Reading the minimum is O(1), while insertion and removing the minimum are O(log n). Searching for an arbitrary value is not generally logarithmic.","options":[{"c":"Read the minimum in O(1)","ok":true},{"c":"Insert a value in O(log n)","ok":true},{"c":"Find any arbitrary value in O(log n)","ok":false,"code":"HEAP_AS_SEARCH_TREE"},{"c":"Produce all values sorted in O(n) total time","ok":false,"code":"HEAP_SORT_LINEAR"}]},

